    "body": "The trouble here is that even if we installed Nerd Fonts, it would be difficult for us to set them as the terminal emulator's font. We _could_ check to see if Nerd Fonts are installed and warn the user if they try to use starship without them. 🤔 \r\n\r\nAll that aside, we certainly should have it added to our README as a dependency for this project. 😄",
